      "message": "Yeah, this is not cool. 35ms with interrupts disable will ruin both sensors and tcpc timings. I would rather have the host stretch the transaction while it\u0027s servicing an interrupt or a higher priority task.\n\nPlease leave interrupts enabled.\n\nIf this is really the only way, we should just do this in a high priority task (but even then, there are plenty of tasks that need to get to work in faster latencies than 35ms).",
